OVERVIEW: Export volume in various formats (NIfTI, MetaImage)

USAGE: dicom-3d export <input-paths> ... --output <output> [--formats <formats>] [--verbose]

ARGUMENTS:
  <input-paths>           Input DICOM files (multi-slice series)

OPTIONS:
  -o, --output <output>   Output file prefix
  --formats <formats>     Export formats: nifti, metaimage (default: nifti)
  --verbose               Verbose output
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

